# .agents — AI Agent Navigation and Workspace Operational Guide

> **Context**: This workspace is dedicated to the development, refactoring, and modernization of **GalactiCraft 5 (GC5)** for **Minecraft 1.21.1 (Fabric)**, as well as porting and integrating features from legacy GalactiCraft addons.

---

## 1. Naming Conventions and Acronyms

To conserve token budget and maintain high-density context without ambiguity, all agents working in this workspace should adhere to the following standard abbreviations:

| Acronym | Full Name | Description |
|---|---|---|
| **`GC`** | GalactiCraft | The overarching franchise / mod concept |
| **`GC4`** | GalactiCraft 4 | The legacy Minecraft 1.12.2 Forge codebase (reference/Rosetta Stone) |
| **`GC5`** | GalactiCraft 5.0 | The modern Minecraft 1.21.1 Fabric core mod |
| **`GCEP`** | GalactiCraft ExtraPlanets | Addon adding Solar System planets, Tiers 4-10 rockets, and radiation |
| **`GCMP`** | GalactiCraft MorePlanets | Addon adding fictional alien planets (Nibiru, Chalos, Diona) & boss fights |
| **`GCZG`** | GalactiCraft Zollern Galaxy | Addon adding multi-star systems, alien biomes, and lore |
| **`GCGS`** | GalactiCraft Galaxy Space | Addon adding real-world stellar systems (Centauri, Barnards) and rocketry |
| **`GCT`** | GalactiCraft Tweaker | CraftTweaker / ZenScript integration for GC recipes |
| **`GCMPE`** | GalactiCraft More Planets Extras | Space stations extension for MorePlanets |
| **`GCC`** | GalactiCraft Computers | OpenComputers sealable cable blocks & automation |
| **`GCRPC`** | GalactiCraft Rich Presence | Discord Rich Presence tracking for celestial bodies |

*(Rule: Use these acronyms in agent conversations, commit messages, and internal notes, but preserve full naming when defining user-facing strings, public Java APIs, or formal documentation).*

